# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GAME DATA -- NEVER COMMIT ANY OF THIS
#
# This repository contains only original work: the server, the analysis tools,
# and documentation of what was found. It must never contain Konami's game data
# or anything mechanically derived from it.
#
# That means no disc images, no files extracted from a disc, no Ghidra projects
# (they embed the binaries), and no strings/disassembly dumps. Everything in
# this block is either the retail game or a derivative of it.
#
# The patches under patches/ and tools/ describe *addresses and instructions*.
# They contain no game code, and are applied by the user to their own disc.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Games/
work/
ghidra/
out/
patches/dist/
*.iso
*.ISO
*.bin
*.BIN
*.img
*.IMG
*.elf
SLUS_*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local state and secrets
#
# registrations.json holds account names and passwords posted by clients.
# state.json holds account keys and player files. xorkey.bin is recovered at
# runtime from the first client that connects.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
state/
*.log
state.json
registrations.json
results.json
ddr.db
ddr.db-wal
ddr.db-shm
content.json
admin_token
*.unreadable
xorkey.bin
selftest_key.bin
hosts.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
